abstract: >-
  Analysis code, recovered historical dataset, synthetic signal corpus,
  validation gates and figure/table generation for a study of how total-energy
  retention can mask fluctuation reconstruction error under DC dominance in DFT
  coefficient selection. A single command regenerates every reported value.
